{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07892","headline":"卢明府九日岘山宴袁使君张郎中崔员外 · 孟浩然","name":"卢明府九日岘山宴袁使君张郎中崔员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宇宙谁开辟，江山此郁盘。\n登临今古用，风俗岁时观。\n地理荆州分，天涯楚塞宽。\n百城今刺史，华省旧郎官。\n共美重阳节，俱怀落帽欢。\n酒邀彭泽载，琴辍武城弹。\n献寿先浮菊，寻幽或藉兰。\n烟虹铺藻翰，松竹挂衣冠。\n叔子神如在，山公兴未阑。\n传闻骑马醉，还向习池看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07892.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07892","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}